  <para style="h">Galata</para>
  <para style="toc1">Galata bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galata</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt1">Galata bi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1-2" />Kɛ je Paulo nɛ ji bɔfo kɛ nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. Kɛ ha: Galata asafo ɔmɛ. Ami Paulo nɛ ji bɔfo nɛ pi kuu ko loo nɔmlɔ ko nɛ tsɛ mi, se mohu Yesu Kristo nitsɛ kɛ Tsɛ Mawu nɔ nɛ tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ɔ nɛ tsɛ mi ɔ, nɛ ngɛ womi nɛ ɔ ngmae kɛ ya ha Galata asafo ɔmɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3" />Dloomi kɛ jɔɔmi nɛ je Tsɛ Mawu ɔ kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4" />Yesu, nɔ nɛ ngɔ e muɔ kɛ sã bɔ ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a he, kaa bɔ nɛ wa Tsɛ Mawu ɔ to ɔ, nɛ e kpɔ wɔ kɛ je je nɛ ɔ mi yayami nɛ wa ngɛ mi nɛ ɔ mi. <verse eid="GAL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5" />A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Mawu kɛ ya neneene. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manye Munyu kpa ko be</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6" />Ye nya kpɛ ye he kaa e kɛ we kulaa nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he tsɔe kɛ ngɛ Mawu he jee, nɔ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ ngɛ e suɔmi kɛ dloomi ɔ nya kɛ ba neneene wami nɛ e ha nyɛ kɛ gu Kristo nɔ ɔ mi ɔ, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ blɔ kpa nɛ kɛ nɔ yɛ Hiɔwe kulaa a nɔ gue. <verse eid="GAL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7" />Blɔ kpa ko be pe nɔ́ nɛ wa tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ, nɛ nihi nɛ plɛ Kristo he anɔkuale munyu ɔ hɛ mi kɛ bu si ɔ, a ngɛ nyɛ kuasia pee.<verse eid="GAL 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8" />Ke nɔ ko loo ami po loo bɔfo nɛ je hiɔwe tete ba fiɛ yi wami hemi blɔ kpa ko kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ ngɛ nɔ nɛ wa fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ se ɔ, Mawu gbiɛmi nɛ ba jamɛatsɛ ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9" />I ngɛ dee ekohu ke, ke nɔ ko ma ba fiɛ Manye Munyu kpa ko kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ he ye momo nɛ ɔ se ɔ, Mawu gbiɛmi nɛ tloo jamɛatsɛ ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10" />Nyɛ maa na kaa tsa pi nya mi dɔkɔdɔkɔ nɛ i ngɛ pee bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma sa nyɛ hɛ mi. Dabi, i ngɛ dengme gboe nɛ ma sa Mawu hɛ mi, ejakaa ke nimli a hɛ mi i ngɛ hlae nɛ ma sa a, lɛɛ tsa pi Kristo tsɔlɔ ji mi.<verse eid="GAL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11" />Mamimɛ, suɔli, i ngɛ nyɛ dee ke, Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ i ngɛ fiɛe ɔ, tsa pi nimli a dɛ mi nɛ e je, nɛ e pi nlami munyu hulɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12" />Ejakaa ye munyu ɔ ji nɔ kpa ko ngɔ, pe Yesu Kristo, nɛ lɛ e tsɔɔ mi nɔ nɛ ma de.<verse eid="GAL 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13" />Nyɛ le bɔ nɛ i ngɛ ha benɛ i ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a jami ɔ se nyɛɛe, nɛ i wa Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ yi mi kɛ hɛ dɔ, nɛ i bɔ mɔde kaa ma kpata asafo ɔ hɛ mi. <verse eid="GAL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14" />I pe ye juami Yuda bi fuu ngɛ jami ɔ mi ngɛ zugba a nɔ jamɛ a be ɔ mi, nɛ i gboɔ dengme kaa ma ye wa tsɛmɛ a blema jami ɔ mi mlaa amɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15" />Se ngɛ Mawu dloomi kɛ mi mi jɔmi nya a, e hla mi be mi nɛ a na we nɛ a fɔ mi po, nɛ e tsɛ mi ke ma ba sɔmɔ lɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16" />E je e bi ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mi konɛ ma ya fiɛ e he Manye Munyu ɔ ngɔ tsɔɔ ma je li ɔmɛ. Se be mi nɛ enɛ ɔmɛ ba mi ɔ, i jaje we kɛ de we nɔ ko. <verse eid="GAL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17" />Nɛ i yɛ Yerusalem nɛ ma ya na bɔfohi nɛ nyɛɛ ye hɛ mi ɔ nɛ a to mi blɔ nya ko; se mohu, i pue nɔ amlɔ ɔ nɔuu kɛ ho Arabia nga a nɔ ya, nɛ lɔ ɔ se loko i kpale kɛ ba Damasko ma a mi ekohu. <verse eid="GAL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18" />Jeha etɛ se loko ji i ya Yerusalem, nɛ i ya slaa Petro nɛ i kɛ lɛ hi si ligbi nyɔngma kɛ enuɔ. <verse eid="GAL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19" />Yakobo nɛ ji wa Nutsɔ ɔ nyɛminyumu ɔ pɛ ji bɔfo ɔmɛ a ti nɔ nɛ i na ngɛ lejɛ ɔ jamɛ a be ɔ mi. <verse eid="GAL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20" />Nyɛɛ bu níhi nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee nɛ ɔ tue saminya, ejakaa Mawu hɛ mi i ngɛ nyɛ dee ngɛ. Nɔ́ nɛ ba mi ɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ ji nɛ ɔ nɛ, tsa pi lakpa nɛ i ngɛ yee. <verse eid="GAL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21" />Enɛ ɔ se ɔ i ya Siria kɛ Kilikia ma amɛ a mi. <verse eid="GAL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22" />Se loloolo ɔ, Yudea Kristo asafo ɔ li nɔ́ nɛ ji mi. <verse eid="GAL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23" />Nɔ́ nɛ kɛkɛ nɛ a le ji nɔ́ nɛ nihi ngɛ dee ke, “Wa sa he nyɛlɔ ɔ bɔni hemi kɛ yemi nɛ e ngɛ hlae nɛ e kpata hɛ mi ɔ fiɛmi amlɔ nɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="GAL 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24" />Nɛ a wo Mawu hɛ mi nyami kɛ gu ye nɔ.<verse eid="GAL 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1" />Jeha nyɔngma kɛ eywiɛ se ɔ, i kɛ Barnaba kpale kɛ ba Yerusalem, nɛ Tito hu piɛɛ wa he. <verse eid="GAL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2" />I ya lejɛ ɔ ngɛ Mawu blɔ tsɔɔmi pɔtɛɛ nɔ, nɛ i kɛ nyɛmi ɔmɛ ya susu Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ i ngɛ fiɛe ngɛ ma je li ɔmɛ a kpɛti ɔ he. I kɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ ya na ni sɛɛmi ngɛ laami mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a nu nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ sisi. Nɛ i he ye kaa a na kaa e ji anɔkuale. <verse eid="GAL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3" />A kɛ mi kpa gbi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, a bi we ke a wo Tito nɛ ji ma je no nɛ piɛ ye he ɔ nyumu mi lo.<verse eid="GAL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mlaa a he nya sami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4" />Se lakpa Kristo se nyɛɛli komɛ ju si kɛ ba sɛ asafo ɔ mi nɛ a ba hyɛ wa he jɔmi nɛ wa na ngɛ Kristo Yesu mi ɔ ha kaa wa ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yee lo. A bɔ mɔde nɛ a fi wɔ kɛ a mlaa amɛ kaa nyɔguɛhi. <verse eid="GAL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5" />Se wa bui mɛ tue hɛ ngmɛfia kake po, ejakaa wa sume nɛ wa futu nyɛ juɛmi nɛ nyɛ susu kaa nyumu mi womi kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ nɛ a maa gu kɛ he nyɛ yi wami.<verse eid="GAL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6" />Nɛ asafo ɔ mi nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ a buu mɛ ɔ, a kɛ nɔ́ kpa ko piɛ we nɔ́ nɛ i tsɔɔ ɔ he. Se ami lɛɛ i nɛ mi gbami ko ngɛ wɔ kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a buu mɛ kaa mɛ ji nikɔtɔma amɛ ɔ wa kpɛti, ejakaa wɔ tsuo ɔ, nimli kake ji wɔ ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi. <verse eid="GAL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7" />Anɔkuale ji, a na kaa a to Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi ni tsumi ɔ kɛ wo ye dɛ, nɛ ma fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ ma je li ɔmɛ kaa bɔ nɛ a to kɛ wo Petro dɛ nɛ e fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ Yuda bi ɔmɛ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8" />Mawu, nɔ nɛ pee Petro bɔfo kɛ ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ ɔ, lɛ nɔuu nɛ e pee mi bɔfo kɛ ha ma je li ɔmɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9" />Nɛ benɛ a na dloomi nɛ a kɛ dloo mi ɔ, Yakobo kɛ Kefa kɛ Yohane nɛ a buu mɛ kaa asafo ɔ hɛ mi nyɛɛli ɔ, a kpa a hiɔ nine mi kɛ sa i kɛ Barnaba wa dɛ kaa huɛ bɔmi okadi, konɛ wɔɔ lɛɛ waa ya ma je li ɔmɛ a ngɔ, nɛ mɛ hu a ya Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ngɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10" />Se a bi wɔ nɛ waa ye kɛ bua ohiafo ɔmɛ be fɛɛ be, nɛ enɛ ɔ ji ami hu ye susumi.<verse eid="GAL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11" />Se benɛ Petro ba Antiokia a, i kã e hɛ mi saminya, ejakaa e pee we nɔ nɛ da. <verse eid="GAL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12" />Ejakaa, benɛ e ba kekle ɔ e kɛ ma je li ɔmɛ yeɔ ni. Se benɛ Yakobo huɛhi Yuda bi komɛ ba a, e kɛ mɛ kpa ni yemi, ejakaa e ngɛ Yudea mlaa leli ɔmɛ gbeye yee ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ a ma de he, akɛnɛ mɛɛ a ma nɔ mi kaa ja a wo nɔ ko nyumu mi loko a ma he e yi wami ;. <verse eid="GAL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Yuda bi nɛ ji Kristo se nyɛɛli kpa amɛ kɛ Barnaba tete peeɔ osatotsɛmɛ, ejakaa a peeɔ nɔ́ nɛ Petro pee ɔ, be mi nɛ a le nɔ́ nɛ sa kaa a pee. <verse eid="GAL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14" />Benɛ i na nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ yae kaa a yi anɔkuale ngɛ a hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi, nɛ a nyɛɛ we Manye Munyu ɔ e anɔkuale ɔ se ɔ, i de Petro ngɛ mɛ tsuo a hɛ mi ke, “Mo nɛ o ji Yuda no, se o kpa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi pi mwɔnɛ ɔ, kɛ peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ o nyɛɛ ma je li nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ kaa a ye jamɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ?” <verse eid="GAL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15" />I kɛ mo ɔ, Yuda fɔfɔɛhi ji wɔ, nɛ wa pi ma je li yayami peeli. <verse eid="GAL 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16" />Se kɛ ɔ, wɔ Yuda bi Kristo se nyɛɛli, wa le klɛdɛɛ kaa a be Yuda bi Kristo se nyɛɛli a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi ɔ nɔ gue kɛ he wa yi wami, kaa ja Yesu Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ nɔ nɛ a maa gu kɛ kpɔ wɔ kɛ je wa yayami ɔmɛ a mi. Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, wɔ hu wa he Yesu Kristo nɔ ye konɛ Mawu nɛ he wa yi wami kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ, se pi Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi he je, ejakaa a be nɔ ko yi wami hee kɛ gu mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ.<verse eid="GAL 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17" />Ke wɔ nɛ wa heɔ Kristo nɔ yeɔ kɛ ha wa yi wami hemi ɔ, wa na kaa nɔ́ nɛ wa ngɛ pee ɔ dɛ, se a be wa yi wami nyɛe ma he ke ji a wui wɔ nyumu mi, nɛ wa yi Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa kpa amɛ hu a nɔ ɔ, anɛ wa ma nyɛ de ke Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ kpata wa hɛ mi lo? Dabi, e sɛ kaa nɔ ko susuu kikɛmɛ a nɔ́ ko kɛ siɔ wa Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18" />Se mohu, wa peeɔ yayami peeli ke ji ni momo ɔmɛ nɛ i ngɛ a hɛ mi kpatae, nɛ ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi kɛ ha yi wami hemi ɔ, wa kpale ngɛ mɛ pee. <verse eid="GAL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19" />Ejakaa kɛ gu Ngmami ɔ kanemi nɔ ɔ i na kaa i be Mawu hɛ mi nyɛe ma sa kɛ gu mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ. Se i ma sa Mawu hɛ mi ke i he Kristo nɔ ye.<verse eid="GAL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20" />A sɛu mi kɛ Kristo, nɛ enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, tsa pi ami nɛ ye hɛ ngɛ hu, se Kristo nɛ e hɛ ngɛ ngɛ ye mi. Nɛ wami nɛ ngɛ ye nɔmlɔ tso nɛ ɔ mi ɔ, e je hemi kɛ yemi nɛ i ngɛ ngɛ Mawu Bi ɔ mi, nɔ nɛ suɔ mi nɛ e gbo kɛ ha mi ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21" />I be nihi nɛ ngɔɔ Kristo gbenɔ ɔ kaa nɔ́ ko nɛ se nami be he ɔ a kpɛti. Ejakaa ke a ma nyɛ he wa yi wami kɛ gu Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ ɔ, lɛɛ e he hia we kaa Kristo nɛ e gbo.<verse eid="GAL 2:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mlaa amɛ he we nɔ́ yi wami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1" />Oo, Galata bi nɛ be juɛmi! Mɛnɔ nyua nyɛ? Anɛ tsa pi nyɛ nɛ nyɛ nu Kristo gbenɔ ɔ sisi paa kaa nɔ́ nɛ i kɛ Kristo nɛ a sɛu lɛ ngɛ tso nɔ ɔ e he foni to nyɛ hɛ mi ɔ lo? <verse eid="GAL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2" />Ma suɔ nɛ ma bi nyɛ munyu nɛ ɔ ke: Anɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ nɛ nyɛ gu kɛ na Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ lo? Dabi, ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ba nyɛ nɔ benɛ nyɛ nu Kristo sane ɔ nɛ nyɛ he ye kaa e ma he nyɛ yi wami ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3" />Anɛ pe nyɛ yi mi puɛ kulaa jehanɛ ɔ lo? Ejakaa ke kekle ɔ, mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi ha we nyɛ mumi mi wami ɔ, kɛ peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ jehanɛ ɔ lɛɛ nyɛ susuu kaa mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi maa pee nyɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli kpakpahi? <verse eid="GAL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4" />Lɛɛ nɔ́ babauu nɛ nyɛ na ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ he nɛ ɔ, nyɛ ma ha nɛ e pee yaka gu lo? I he we yi!<verse eid="GAL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5" />I ngɛ nyɛ bie ekohu ke, anɛ Mawu ngɔ Mumi Klɔuklɔu he wami ɔ kɛ ha nyɛ nɛ e tsu nyakpɛ níhi ngɛ nyɛ mi, ejakaa nyɛ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ́ yee lo? Dabi! E baa mi ja ke o he Kristo nɔ ye nɛ o kɛ o hɛ fɔ e nɔ kulaa.<verse eid="GAL 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6" />Ja a nɔuu nɛ e ba mi ha Abraham. Akɛnɛ e he Mawu si womi ɔmɛ ye he je ɔ, Mawu bu lɛ dalɔ nɛ e ha lɛ hiɔwe he blɔ, <verse eid="GAL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7" />Nyɛ maa na kɛ je enɛ ɔ mi kaa nihi nɛ je Abraham mi tutuutu ji nihi nɛ ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ a heɔ Mawu nɔ yeɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8-9" />Nɛ Ngmami ɔ hyɛ be nɛ ɔ blɔ, be nɛ Mawu ma he ma je li ɔmɛ a yi wami kɛ gu a hemi kɛ yemi nɔ ɔ. Mawu de Abraham enɛ ɔ momoomo ngɔ to benɛ e de lɛ ke, “Ma jɔɔ ma tsuaa ma nɔ bimɛ nɛ heɔ ye nɔ yeɔ kaa mo ɔ.” Nɛ ja a ji bɔ nɛ e ngɛ. Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ heɔ Kristo nɔ yeɔ ɔ, e naa jɔɔmi nɛ Abraham na a eko.<verse eid="GAL 3:8-9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10" />Anɔkuale ji kaa Mawu gbiɛmi ngɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a juɛmi ji kaa a ma na yi wami hemi kɛ gu Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ, ejakaa Ngmami ɔ deɔ paa ke, “Gbiɛmi ngɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma tɔ mlaahi nɛ a ngma ngɛ Mawu Mlaa Womi ɔ mi ɔ kake nɔ ɔ.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11" />Enɛ ɔ tsɔɔ paa kaa nɔ ko be nyɛe maa sa Mawu hɛ mi kɛ gu Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi nɔ, ejakaa Mawu deɔ wɔ ke hemi kɛ yemi nɔ pɛ wa maa gu kɛ sa e hɛ mi. Gbalɔ Habakuk ye enɛ ɔ he odase ke, “Nɔ nɛ ngɛ yi wami hemi hlae ɔ, e ma na ngɛ Mawu nɔ hemi kɛ yemi mi.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12" />Mlaa a, tsa pi hemi kɛ yemi mi nɛ e je, se mohu, nɔ nɛ yeɔ mlaa a nɔ ɔ, e yi ma na wami ngɛ mi. <verse eid="GAL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13" />Se Kristo kpɔ wɔ kɛ je jamɛ a hɛ mi kpatami si himi ɔ mi nɛ e wo wa he yayami ɔmɛ a he gbiɛmi ɔ kɛ fɔ lɛ nitsɛ e nɔ. Ejakaa a de ngɛ Ngmami ɔ mi ke, “Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a sɛu lɛ ngɛ tso nɔ ɔ, a gbiɛ lɛ.”<verse eid="GAL 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu si womi ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14" />Nɛ jehanɛ ɔ, Mawu maa jɔɔ ma je li ɔmɛ hu kaa bɔ nɛ e wo Abraham si ɔ; nɛ wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli tsuo wa nine maa su Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ nɛ a wo wɔ he si ɔ nɔ kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15" />Mamimɛ, suɔli, ngɛ wa si himi mi tete ɔ, ke nɔ ko wo nɔ́ ko si nɛ e ngma womi kɛ fɔ nɔ ɔ, e be nyɛe ma tsake. Nɛ e be nyɛe maa pee nɔ́ kpa ngɛ lɔ ɔ se hulɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16" />Mawu ha Abraham kɛ e Bi ɔ si womi komɛ. E tsɔɔ we kaa e bi ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ a wo si ɔ, se mohu e Bi kake ɔ, nɔ nɛ ji Kristo ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17" />Nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ tsɔɔe ɔ ji, yi wami hemi kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ he si nɛ Mawu wo ɔ, e tsakee we nɛ a pui mi ngɛ jeha lafa eywiɛ kɛ nyingmi etɛ se be nɛ Mawu wo Kita Nyɔngma amɛ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18" />Ke ji jamɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi ma he wa yi wami ɔ, lɛɛ e tsɔɔ kaa e ji blɔ nya tomi kpa ko nɛ wa maa gu nɔ kɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi, se pi Abraham nɔ ɔ, ejakaa Abraham lɛɛ Mawu si womi ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ e ngɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19" />Jehanɛ ɔ, mɛni he je nɛ a wo mlaa amɛ mɔ? Nimli a tɔmihi a he je nɛ a kɛ mlaa amɛ piɛ si womi ɔ he ngɛ, konɛ a kɛ na bɔ nɛ a ngɛ Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ tɔe ha. Se mlaa nɔ yemi nɛ ɔ maa hi si kɛ ya si Kristo bami be pɛ, lɛ ji Bi ɔ nɛ Mawu ha si womi ɔ nɛ. Nɛ slɔɔto kake hu nɛ ngɛ mi ji, Mawu wo e mlaa amɛ kɛ gu bɔfohi a nɔ kɛ ba ha Mose, nɛ lɛ hu e wo kɛ ha nimli ɔmɛ. <verse eid="GAL 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20" />Se benɛ e ma ha e si womi ɔ lɛɛ Abraham nitsɛ nɛ e kɛ ha, e kɛ gui bɔfohi loo nɔ ko kaa Mose nɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21-22" />Anɛ Mawu mlaa amɛ kɛ e si womi ɔmɛ kɔ we lo? Dabi! Ejakaa a ke e mlaa amɛ ma nyɛ wa yi wami ma he jinɛ Mawu be blɔ kpa jee kɛ ha wɔ nɛ wa kɛ je wa he kɛ je yayami mi. Ejakaa Ngmami ɔmɛ de ke wɔ tsuo wa peeɔ yayami nyɔguɛhi. Nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, blɔ nɔ nɛ a maa gu kɛ kpɔ wɔ ji kɛ gu Yesu Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi nɔ; nɛ kikɛmɛ a blɔ nɛ ɔ ngɛ kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ma he e nɔ maa ye ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23" />Loko Kristo ba a, mlaa a ji nɔ́ nɛ ngɛ wa he bue; a nu wɔ kɛ wo mlaa a sisi nɛ a nga wa yi kaa nihi nɛ a wo mɛ tsu mi kɛ ya si wa he Yiwamihelɔ nɛ ma a nɔ ye.<verse eid="GAL 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24" />Lɔ ɔ ji kaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ plɛ wa tsɔɔli nɛ kpaka wɔ kɛ ya si Kristo ba nɛ e ba tsa waa kɛ Mawu kpɛti kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25" />Se nɛ Kristo ba nɛ ɔ, mlaa amɛ a he hia we wɔ hu kaa a tsɔɔ wɔ blɔ kɛ ya Mawu ngɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26" />Ejakaa, amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Mawu bimɛ ji wɔ tsuo kɛ gu Yesu Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi nɔ; <verse eid="GAL 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27" />nɛ wɔ nihi tsuo nɛ a baptisi wɔ ngɔ wo Kristo nɛ waa kɛ lɛ pee kake ɔ mi ɔ, e ha wa nɔ. <verse eid="GAL 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, Yuda no ko be, Hela no ko hu be, nyɔguɛ ko be, nɛ odehe ko be hu, nyumu be nɛ yo hu be, ejakaa nɔ kake ji wɔ tsuo ngɛ Kristo Yesu mi. <verse eid="GAL 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29" />Ke Kristo nihi ji wɔ ɔ, lɛɛ Abraham nina tutuutu ji wɔ, nɛ si womihi nɛ Mawu ha lɛ ɔ, a peeɔ wa nɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1" />Nyɛ kai enɛ ɔ kaa ke tsɛ ko gbo nɛ e si gbosi ni kɛ ha e bi nɛ wɛ lolo ɔ, e ngɛ mi kaa e tsɛ ni ɔmɛ kulaa peeɔ e nɔ́ mohu, se mi gbami ko be e kɛ a nyɔguɛ kpɛti kɛ yaa si e maa wa nɛ e ma ba ye ni ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2" />E ngɛ nɔ hyɛli kɛ nikɔtɔmahi a sisi nɛ e buɔ mɛ tue kɛ yaa si be nɛ e tsɛ ɔ to ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu kpɔ wɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3" />Ja a nɔuu nɛ wɔ hu wa ngɛ loko Kristo ba. Wa hi Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaahi kɛ kusumihi a sisi kaa nyɔguɛhi, ejakaa wa susu kaa a ma he wa yi wami. <verse eid="GAL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4" />Se benɛ be nɛ Mawu to ɔ su ɔ, e tsɔ lɛ nitsɛ e Bi ɔ kɛ ba, nɛ yo fɔ lɛ kɛ je Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mi, <verse eid="GAL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5" />konɛ e ba kpɔ wɔ nihi nɛ wa ngɛ mlaa nyɔguɛ yemi sisi ɔ, nɛ e ngɔ wɔ kɛ pee lɛ nitsɛ e bimɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6" />Nɛ akɛnɛ e bimɛ ji wɔ he je ɔ, Mawu tsɔ e Bi ɔ Mumi ɔ kɛ ba wa tsui mi, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ma nyɛ tsɛ Mawu jehanɛ ke wa Suɔlɔ Tsɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, tsa pi nyɔguɛhi ji wɔ hu, se mohu Mawu nitsɛ e bimɛ ji wɔ. Nɛ ke e bimɛ ji wɔ ɔ, lɛɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e ngɛ ɔ, e peeɔ wa nɔ́ ngɛ Mawu nitsɛ e blɔ nya tomi ɔ nya.<verse eid="GAL 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8" />Sa a, be mi nɛ nyɛ ma je li ɔmɛ nyɛ li Mawu ɔ, nyɛ pee nyɛ he nyɔguɛhi kɛ ha níhi nɛ a tsɛɛ mɛ ke mawuhi, nɛ tete po ɔ, nɔ́ ko be kaa ja. <verse eid="GAL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9" />Se jehanɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ le Mawu ɔ, aloo nɛ Mawu le nyɛ ɔ, kɛ peeɔ kɛɛ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hlae kaa nyɛ maa kpale nyɛ se nɛ nyɛ ya pee nyɔguɛhi ekohu kɛ ha jami nɛ he be se nami, nɔ́ nɛ tsɔɔ Mawu mlaahi a nɔ yemi loko a ma na hiɔwe yami he blɔ ɔ? <verse eid="GAL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10" />Nyɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi kɛ gu níhi nɛ nyɛ peeɔ aloo nyɛ pee we ngɛ ligbi komɛ a nɔ loo nyɔhiɔ komɛ loo be komɛ loo jeha komɛ a mi ɔ a nɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11" />I ngɛ gbeye yee kaa i gbo yaka dengme ngɛ nyɛ he.<verse eid="GAL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo nine mi je wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12" />Mamimɛ, i ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae kaa nyɛ susu ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he saminya kaa bɔ nɛ i susuu a he ɔ. Ejakaa i ye ye he kɛ je ni nɛ ɔmɛ a mi kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ ngɛ sa a. Nyɛ nyangee we mi be mi nɛ i fiɛ kɛ ha nyɛ kekle ɔ; <verse eid="GAL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13" />nɛ e ngɛ mi kaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi nɛ i kɛ Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ ba ha nyɛ ɔ, i be nɔmlɔ tso mi he wami mohu. <verse eid="GAL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14" />Ye hiɔ ɔ pee nya tsɔmi nɔ́ kɛ ha nyɛ, se nyɛ kua we mi nɛ nyɛ fie we mi hulɔ. Nyɛ he mi atuu nɛ nyɛ hyɛ ye nɔ kaa nɔ́ nɛ Mawu bɔfo ji mi aloo Yesu Kristo nitsɛ nɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15" />Jije jamɛ a bua jɔmi mumi ɔ nɛ wɔ tsuo wa na a ngɛ? Ejakaa i he ye jamɛ a be ɔ mi kaa nyɛ ma nyɛ hia nyɛ hɛ ngmɛhi tete ngɔ ha mi kɛ to ye nɔ́ ɔmɛ a nane mi ke a hi ha mi.<verse eid="GAL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16" />Anɛ jehanɛ ɔ i plɛ nyɛ he nyɛlɔ ngɛ anɔkuale ɔ nɛ i tuɔ kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ he lo?<verse eid="GAL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17" />Jamɛ a lakpa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ hlae nɛ a sa nyɛ hɛ mi ɔ, tsa pi nyɛ kpakpa nɛ a ngɛ hlae. Nɔ́ nɛ a ngɛ hlae ji kaa, a tsi nyɛ ye ngɔ blɔ konɛ nyɛɛ ya a ngɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18" />E ji nɔ́ kpakpa, ke nihi suɔ nyɛ kɛ a tsui mi kulaa, nɛ pi be nɛ i kɛ nyɛ ngɛ ɔ kɛkɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19" />Ye bimɛ kpakpahi, nyɛɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ mi awi yee ha! I ngɛ nɔ́ nae ngɛ nyɛ he ekohu kaa bɔ nɛ yofɔyo nuu kɔɔmi nɛ e hii nɔ nae kɛ ya siɔ be nɛ e fɔɔ ɔ, ja a nɔuu ami hu i nu kɔɔmi nɛ i ngɛ blɔ hyɛe kɛ yaa si be nɛ nyɛ ma na Kristo ngɛ nyɛ mi. <verse eid="GAL 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20" />I na nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ kasa nya amlɔ nɛ ɔ, se pi nɛ i kɛ nyɛ waa tu munyu kɛ je se lokoo kikɛ ɔ, nɛ i li bɔ nɛ ma pee.<verse eid="GAL 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21" />Nyɛɛ bu mi tue, nyɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛ susu kaa Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi ɔ ma he nyɛ yi wami ɔ. Mɛni he je nɛ nyɛ hla we nɛ nyɛɛ le nɔ́ nɛ mlaa amɛ ngɛ tsɔɔe tutuutu? <verse eid="GAL 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22" />Ejakaa a ngma ke Abraham ngɛ bimɛ enyɔ, nɔ kake ɔ, e kɛ yo nyɔguɛ ɔ nɛ fɔ; nɛ nɔ nɛ ji enyɔne ɔ hu e kɛ e yo odehe ɔ nɛ fɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23" />Nyakpɛ nɔ́ ko be bi ɔ nɛ e kɛ yo nyɔguɛ ɔ fɔ ɔ he; se bi ɔ nɛ e kɛ odehe ɔ fɔ ɔ, a wo e fɔmi he si loko ji a fɔ lɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24-25" />Anɔkuale sane nɛ ɔ tsɔɔ blɔhi enyɔ nɔ nɛ Mawu guu kɛ yeɔ kɛ buaa nɔ. Kekle blɔ ɔ ji, e ha Mose mlaa nɛ ji Kita Nyɔngma a ngɛ Sinai Yoku ɔ nɔ ke a ye nɔ. Arabia bi tsɛɛ Sinai Yoku ɔ ke “Hagar Yoku.” Nɛ ngɛ ye sane ɔ nya tsɔɔmi mi ɔ, Abraham yo nyɔguɛ ɔ nɛ a tsɛɛ ke Hagar a daa si ngɛ Yerusalem nɛ ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a ma ngua a nane mi. Nɛ lejɛ ɔ ji Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi kɛ ha Mawu hɛ mi sami ɔ a he ni tsumi he. Nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ jamɛ a mlaa amɛ a sisi ɔ ji e bimɛ nyɔguɛ ɔmɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26" />Se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa ma ngua ji Yerusalem nɛ ngɛ hiɔwe ɔ, nɛ lɛɛ e pi nyɔguɛ kɛ ha Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ.<verse eid="GAL 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27" />Lɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ Yesaia ngɛ tsɔɔe benɛ e gba ke, “Na bua jɔmi jehanɛ, mo yosa. O ma nyɛ kpa ngmlaa kɛ bua jɔmi, tse be ɔ, o nui kɔɔmi hyɛ; ejakaa i ma ha mo bimɛ fuu pe nɔ nɛ yo nyɔguɛ ɔ ngɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28" />Anyɛmimɛ, suɔli, i kɛ nyɛ tsuo ɔ, Mawu si womi ɔ mi bimɛ ji wɔ kaa bɔ nɛ Isak ngɛ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ hlae kaa waa ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ ɔ, a ngɛ wɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ a fɔ ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi ɔ yi mi wae kaa bɔ nɛ Ishmael nɛ ji nyɔguɛ ɔ bi ɔ wa Isak odehe bi ɔ yi mi ɔ.<verse eid="GAL 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30" />Se Ngmami ɔ tsɔɔ kaa Mawu de Abraham ke e fie yo nyɔguɛ ɔ kɛ e bi ɔ, ejakaa e sɛ kaa yo nyɔguɛ ɔ bi ɔ kɛ odehe ɔ bi ɔ tsuo yeɔ Abraham gbosi ni nɛ ji e we kɛ e zugba amɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31" />Mamimɛ, suɔli, enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, tsa pi yo nyɔguɛ ɔ bimɛ nɛ ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a sisi ɔmɛ ji wɔ. Se wɔɔ lɛɛ odehe ɔ bimɛ ji wɔ, nɛ Mawu ngɔ wɔ ngɛ wa hemi kɛ yemi ɔ he.<verse eid="GAL 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kristo ha wa ye wa he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, jehanɛ ɔ nɛ Kristo ha nɛ wa ye wa he ɔ, nyɛɛ da si kpitikplii, nɛ nyɛ ko ha nɛ a wo Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa kɛ kusumi ɔmɛ a nɔ yemi kɛ ye nyɛ nyɔguɛ hu. <verse eid="GAL 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2" />Nyɛɛ bu tue, ejakaa munyu nɛ ɔ he hia saminya: ke ji nyɛ ngɛ nyumu mi womi ɔ kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a se die nɛ nyɛ kɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi ɔ, lɛɛ Kristo be nyɛ yi wami nyɛe ma he. <verse eid="GAL 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3" />I ngɛ nyɛ dee ekohu ke, nyumu tsuaa nyumu nɛ ngɛ nyumu mi womi ɔ se die kaa e ma kɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi ɔ, e sa nɛ e ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ kulaa nɔ daa, ke pi ja a, e hɛ mi ma kpata. <verse eid="GAL 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4" />Kristo he be se nami kɛ ha nɔ nɛ ngɛ mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi se die kɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi, ejakaa Mawu dloomi ɔ bɔ lɛ.<verse eid="GAL 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5" />Se wɔɔ lɛɛ ngɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ yemi kɛ buami nya a, wa wo wa hɛ kɛ fɔ Kristo gbenɔ ɔ nɔ kaa e ma kpata waa kɛ Mawu kpɛti. <verse eid="GAL 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6" />Nɛ wɔ nihi nɛ Kristo ha wɔ neneene wami ɔ, e he hia we nɛ waa hao kaa a wo wɔ nyumu mi aloo a wui wɔ, aloo kaa wa ngɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi ɔmɛ a nɔ yee aloo wa yi nɔ. Se mohu nɔ́ nɛ kɛkɛ nɛ he hia wɔ ji hemi kɛ yemi nɛ ngɛ ni tsue kɛ gu suɔmi mi.<verse eid="GAL 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7" />Jinɛ nyɛ ngɛ mɔde bɔe saminya. Se mɛnɔ kulaa nɛ ba puɛ nyɛ jehanɛ ɔ kaa nyɛ ko bu anɔkuale ɔ tue hu? <verse eid="GAL 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8" />Kikɛmɛ a juɛmi tsakemi nɛ ɔ ji Mawu nɔ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ ɔ ngɔ, ejakaa lɛ ji nɔ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ ke nyɛ ba na he jɔmi ngɛ Kristo mi. <verse eid="GAL 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9" />Se mohu juɛmi yaya nɛ ɔ gu nɔ kake pɛ nɔ ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti kɛ puɛ nyɛ tsuo.<verse eid="GAL 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10" />I ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ Nutsɔ ɔ nɔ kaa e maa kpale nyɛ kɛ ba hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi kaa bɔ nɛ ami hu i ngɛ ɔ. Nɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ haoe, nɛ a ngɛ nyɛ juɛmi tsakaa a, Mawu kɛ mɛ maa ye.<verse eid="GAL 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11" />Ni komɛ ngɛ dee ke ami nitsɛ tete i ngɛ fiɛe ke nyumu mi womi kɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a he hia ngɛ yi wami hemi ɔ blɔ nya tomi ɔ mi. Se kaa i fiɛ ja a niinɛ ɔ, jinɛ a be mi yi mi wae hu, ejakaa jamɛ a munyu ɔ dɔɛ nɔ ko. Se akɛnɛ a ngɛ mi yi mi wae kɛ sa a tsɔɔ kaa yi wami hemi nɛ a naa kɛ guu Kristo Sɛumi Tso ɔ kɛkɛ nɔ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ fiɛe kpamisa.<verse eid="GAL 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12" />I na nɛ tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ hlae kaa a wo nyɛ nyumu mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ je nyɛ he ɔ, mɛ mohu a je a he kɛ je nyɛ he nɛ a ngmɛɛ nyɛ he.<verse eid="GAL 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13" />Ejakaa, mamimɛ, he yemi nɛ a ha nyɛ, se mohu tsa pi he yemi nɛ a kɛ peeɔ yayami, se he yemi nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ suɔ nyɛ he kɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛ ma kɛ sɔmɔ nyɛ bi. <verse eid="GAL 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14" />Ejakaa mlaa a kulaa e kpiti pomi kɛkɛ ji, “Moo suɔ ni kpahi kaa bɔ nɛ o suɔ mo nitsɛ o he ɔ.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15" />Se ke ji nyɛ sume nyɛ he, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he kɔɔe, nɛ nyɛ ngɛ nyɛ he plaae mohu be fɛɛ be ɔ, lɛɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ saminya. Nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ nyɛ ko puɛ nyɛ he.<verse eid="GAL 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ se nyɛɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16" />I ngɛ nyɛ ga woe kaa nyɛɛ bu Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ kɛkɛ tue. E maa tsɔɔ nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ya, kɛ nɔ́ nɛ nyɛɛ pee. Nɛ nyɛ be níhi nɛ sɛ nɛ nyɛ he lo ɔ ma bi nyɛ ɔ pee. <verse eid="GAL 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17" />Ejakaa akɔnɔ níhi nɛ he lo ɔ dii se, nɛ wa suɔ peemi be fɛɛ be ɔ, a kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ suɔmi nya níhi nɛ e biɔ wɔ ke waa pee ɔ kɔ we; nɛ ni kpakpahi nɛ wa suɔ kaa waa pee be mi nɛ Mumi ɔ kɛ wɔ ngɛ ɔ, a je ekpa ngɛ wa he lo akɔnɔ níhi a he. Nɛ kikɛmɛ a níhi enyɔ nɛ ɔmɛ hii kunɔ nɔe daa ngɛ wa mi nɛ a na wa nɔ he wami, nɛ lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa suɔmi nya ni ɔmɛ na we he jɔmi ngɛ a dɛ mi. <verse eid="GAL 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18" />Ke Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ nyɛ he bue ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi he hia we nyɛ hu.<verse eid="GAL 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19" />Se he lo ɔ se dimi yiblii yaya amɛ ji: susumi yayahi, ajuama bɔmi, gba puɛmi, mu ni tsumi, yahomi, <verse eid="GAL 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20" />wɔ jami, nyuami, nyɛmi, pɛmi, hunga jemi, muklii mi fumi, ngmlaa kpami, he tsumi, atuã tsɔmi, nya sami, mi gbami; <verse eid="GAL 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21" />da demi, nɔmlɔ gbemi, fiɛmi yaya kɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ kaa ni nɛ ɔmɛ. I ngɛ nyɛ dee ekohu kaa bɔ nɛ i de nyɛ momo ɔ ke, nihi nɛ peeɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, a nine be Mawu Matsɛyemi ɔ nɔ sue.<verse eid="GAL 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22" />Se ke Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ wɔ kpakae ɔ, yiblii nɛ e woɔ ngɛ wa mi ji: suɔmi, bua jɔmi, he jɔmi, tsui si tomi, tsui mi jɔmi, kpakpa peemi, anɔkuale yemi, <verse eid="GAL 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23" />he si bami kɛ he nɔ yemi; nɛ ngɛ enɛ ɔmɛ a blɔ fa mi ɔ, Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa amɛ kɛ mɛ be sane ko.<verse eid="GAL 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24" />Ni nɛmɛ nɛ ji Kristo nimli ɔmɛ ɔ, a sɛu a he lo akɔnɔ nɔ́ ɔmɛ kulaa ngɛ e sɛumi tso ɔ he.<verse eid="GAL 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25" />Ke Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ he wami nya nɛ wa ngɛ wami mi ngɛ ɔ, lɛɛ waa nyɛɛ Mumi ɔ blɔ tsɔɔmi se ngɛ wa nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ peemi mi. <verse eid="GAL 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26" />Nyɛ ko ha nɛ wa wo wa he nɔ gojoo bɔ nɛ pee nɛ hɛ kɔ kɛ hetsɛ nɛ ko ba waa kɛ wa nyɛmimɛ a kpɛti.<verse eid="GAL 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1" />Mamimɛ, suɔli, ke nyɛ nyɛmi ko sɛ yayami mi ɔ, nyɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ji dali ɔmɛ ɔ, nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua lɛ ngɛ he si bami kɛ mi mi jɔmi mi, konɛ e kpale kɛ ba blɔ dadɛ ɔ nɔ ekohu, nɛ nyɛ kai kaa eko hwɔɔ se ɔ, tɔmi ma nyɛ ba nyɛ ti nɔ ko hu e blɔ fa mi. <verse eid="GAL 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2" />Nyɛɛ kpee nyɛ he ngɛ nyɛ haomihi kɛ nɔ nami ɔmɛ a mi, nɛ enɛ ɔ ma ha nɛ nyɛɛ ye Kristo mlaa nɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3" />Ke nɔ ko susu kaa nɔ ko ji lɛ nɛ e be enɛ ɔ nɔ nyɛe maa ye ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ e he kuasia nɛ e ngɛ pee.<verse eid="GAL 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e ka lɛ nitsɛ e he nɛ e hyɛ ha kaa e ngɛ mɔde bɔe lo; nɛ ke e bua jɔ e ni tsumi he ɔ, kɛkɛ e kɛ e he be nɔ ko he toe hu. <verse eid="GAL 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5" />Wa ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ tɔmi komɛ kɛ e haomihi nɛ e maa tloo, ejakaa wa ti nɔ ko hí kɛ pi si.<verse eid="GAL 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6" />Nihi nɛ a ngɛ mɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ tsɔɔe ɔ, a wo a tsɔɔli ɔmɛ hiɔ nɛ a kɛ ye kɛ bua mɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ nine mi nɛ ko je wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7" />Nyɛ ko mlɔɔ nyɛ he, nɛ nyɛ susu kaa nyɛ maa kua Mawu nɛ nyɛ maa ye nyɛ he. Nɔ́ nɛ nɔ ko du ɔ, jamɛ a nɔ́ ɔ nɔuu e ma kpa. <verse eid="GAL 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8" />Nɔ nɛ du ni kɛ ha e he lo bua jɔmi nami ɔ, e ngɛ yayami wuhi due, nɛ e ma kpa mumi mi si gbeemi kɛ gbenɔ; se nɔ nɛ duɔ Mumi ɔ nɔ́ kpakpa amɛ ɔ, e ma kpa neneene wami nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ma ha lɛ ɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9" />Wa ko ha nɛ pɔ nɛ tɔ wɔ kɛ kpakpa peemi, ejakaa ke wa jɔɔ we kpakpa peemi ɔ, e be kɛe nɛ wa ma kpa jɔɔmi. <verse eid="GAL 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, be fɛɛ be nɛ wa na he blɔ ɔ, nyɛ ha waa pee nihi tsuo kpakpa, titli ɔ, wa nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli.<verse eid="GAL 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11" />Imi nitsɛ nɛ i ngɛ nyagbe munyu nɛ ɔmɛ ngmae. Nyɛɛ hyɛ bɔ nɛ ningma amɛ kle agboagbo ha! <verse eid="GAL 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12" />Jamɛ a tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nɛ ngɛ hlae kaa a mlɔɔ nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ a wo nyɛ nyumu mi ɔ, nɔ́ kake pɔtɛɛ he je nɛ a ngɛ lɔ ɔ pee ngɛ. A ngɛ pee konɛ a he biɛ nɛ a ko ye mɛ awi, ejakaa ke a kplɛɛ nɔ kaa Kristo sɛumi Tso ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ heɔ nɔ yi wami ɔ, a maa wa mɛ yi mi. <verse eid="GAL 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13" />Nɛ tsɔɔli ɔmɛ nɛ a wo mɛ nyumu mi tete ɔ, a yi Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaa kpa amɛ a nɔ. Se kɛ ɔ, a ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ a wo nyɛ nyumu mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ a fĩa kaa a se nyɛɛli ji nyɛ.<verse eid="GAL 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14" />Ami lɛɛ e ko ba mi kaa i ma fĩa ngɔ fɔ nɔ́ ko nɔ, ja wa Yesu Kristo Sɛumi Tso ɔ kɛkɛ. Ejakaa Sɛumi Tso ɔ he je ɔ, a gbe ye suɔmi nɛ i ngɛ ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi afɛu ni ɔmɛ kulaa a mi ɔ momoomo, nɛ je ɔ hu e suɔmi nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ ye mi ɔ gbo momoomo. <verse eid="GAL 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15" />Nɛ amlɔ nɛ ɔ, slɔɔto ko be nɔ nɛ a wo lɛ nyumu mi kɛ nɔ nɛ a wui lɛ nyumu mi a kpɛti; se mohu oti ɔ ji kaa a tsake wɔ niinɛ nɛ wa plɛ nimli hehi lo.<verse eid="GAL 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16" />Mawu mɔbɔ nami kɛ he jɔmi nɛ ba nihi kulaa nɛ nyɛɔ ngɛ blɔ nya tomi nɛ ɔ nya, kɛ nihi nɛ ngɛ he fɛɛ he nɛ Mawu nihi ji mɛ niinɛ ɔ a nɔ.<verse eid="GAL 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17" />Jehanɛ ɔ, nɔ ko nɛ ko doo ye nya ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he hu, ejakaa pa kɛ pa doku ɔmɛ nɛ i na kɛ je kpa amɛ nɛ Yesu he nyɛli ɔmɛ fiaa mi ɔ ngɛ ye he, nɛ a yeɔ ye he odase kaa e nyɔguɛ ji mi.<verse eid="GAL 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18" />Mamimɛ, wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dloomi ɔ kɛ nyɛ tsuo nɛ hi si.<verse eid="GAL 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6" />
</usx>